Course Launch Prompt Library – Full Prompt Index

01. Identify Gaps in Course Information
Prompt V1
You are a product marketing manager. Review the notes from the course discovery session with University X and identify the gaps in information based on what should make up a complete product brief.

Prompt V2
You are a product marketing manager. Review the course notes and identify the gaps in information based on what should make up a product brief.

List the missing pieces of information in a document with dot points, divided into two sections:

What the university needs to provide
What you can pull together

Prompt V3
You are a product marketing manager. Review the course notes and identify the gaps in information provided based on what should make up a product brief.
Don’t ask the university for information we can find on its website.
List the missing information as questions to send to the university.

